Selling & Marketing Exp |       346.89 |       198.11 |       230.44 |       241.69 |\n| R&D Exp                 |       130.39 |        76.05 |        42.41 |        44.36 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |       148.37 |       135.35 |        56.45 |        93.84 |\n| Operating Income        |      9785.03 |      3782.76 |       779.74 |       480.16 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |        71.80 |        55.60 |        24.14 |        16.10 |\n| Net Income              |      8122.49 |      3262.65 |       420.76 |       373.41 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |        59.60 |        47.95 |        13.02 |        12.52 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |      9373.44 |       373.86 |        54.88 |       692.87 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |       208.90 |        18.36 |      1630.16 |      -732.61 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |        -4.43 |        -7.24 |       -45.18 |        -2.30 |\n| CAPEX                   |        -3.37 |       -13.25 |        -1.78 |        -0.38 |"
